📌 Project Overview
A full end-to-end data analysis project on a logistics and shipment operations dataset from ElectroniTech Manufacturing Co.
The project covers the complete data analytics pipeline — from raw CSV files to an interactive Excel dashboard — using Python, SQL, and Excel.
This project was built as a personal portfolio piece to demonstrate real-world data analysis skills across the full workflow.

